# @hub-lanes

# ── REVIEW-MODE EXPIRE (BH-7123 wave B) ─────────────────────────────────────
# The review dial (bin/review-mode.sh) writes review.mode[.<project>] with an
# expiry in review.mode_until[.<project>]; cowboy and off default to 6h. Every
# 15 minutes this reads the settings snapshot once and flips any expired
# non-levels row back to levels, clears its until row and posts one operator
# line. Idempotent; an unreadable settings read changes nothing. flock -n
# dedupes. Off: flags/lane-off-review-mode-expire or bin/harness-ctl.sh off
# review-mode-expire. It logs itself to logs/review-mode-expire.log.
*/15 * * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/review-mode-expire.sh >/dev/null 2>&1
